    "christmas": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "图文介绍",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Wholesale Christmas Jewelry",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Christmas is one of the strongest retail periods for gifting and seasonal accessories. Developing a dedicated holiday jewelry range gives brands more room to offer limited collections, personalized gift ideas and recognizable festive motifs without relying only on evergreen products.</p><p>Craftaurum can support Christmas jewelry development from concept and sample through repeat production, including earrings, necklaces, rings, charms and gift-led sets. Collections can be adapted around your target metal, plating color, stone direction and packaging plan.</p><p>For wholesale programs, planning early helps secure enough time for sampling, revisions, production and delivery before the holiday sales window.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/Christmas-necklace-gold.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "Start A Christmas Project",
        "cta_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 64,
        "padding_bottom": 80
      }
    },
    "halloween_intro": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "图文介绍",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#f8f7f4",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Halloween Jewelry Wholesale",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "soft-zoom",
        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Halloween collections work best when the jewelry feels immediately seasonal while still fitting the style language of the brand. We can develop themed earrings, rings, necklaces and bracelets around motifs such as moons, stars, pumpkins, ghosts, charms and darker plated finishes.</p><p>Projects can range from lightweight fashion pieces to more refined sterling silver or gold-plated styles. Existing concepts can also be adapted into seasonal colorways, charms or gift sets to reduce development time.</p><ul><li>Halloween earrings</li><li>Halloween rings</li><li>Halloween necklaces</li><li>Halloween bracelets</li></ul>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/halloween-necklace.jpg",
        "image_position": "left",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "",
        "cta_url": "",
        "cta_button_style": "button-unstyled",
        "padding_top": 80,
        "padding_bottom": 40
      }
    },
