    "thanksgiving": {
      "type": "image-text-feature",
      "name": "图文介绍",
      "settings": {
        "section_width": "page-width",
        "background_color": "#ffffff",
        "text_color": "#17191a",
        "accent_color": "#c7a85e",
        "heading": "Supply Thanksgiving Jewelry",
        "heading_size": 35,
        "subtitle_size": 12,
        "body_size": 16,
        "animation_style": "fade-up",
        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button",
        "body": "<p>Thanksgiving jewelry can be positioned around gratitude, gifting and personalized meaning rather than relying only on literal holiday motifs. Custom initials, birthstones, engraved details, warm gold finishes and small giftable pieces are strong directions for this period.</p><p><strong>Custom development:</strong> Translate gifting themes into jewelry that feels personal to the customer or recipient.</p><p><strong>Wholesale production:</strong> Plan quantities and target costs around your campaign without overbuilding inventory.</p><p><strong>Material flexibility:</strong> Develop in sterling silver, solid gold or plated constructions according to the positioning of the collection.</p><p><strong>Production planning:</strong> Starting early leaves enough time for sampling, approval, bulk production and delivery before the retail window.</p>",
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/custom-fashion-jewelry.jpg",
        "image_position": "right",
        "image_ratio": "landscape",
        "cta_label": "Discuss Thanksgiving Jewelry",
        "cta_url": "shopify://pages/contact",
