        "heading_position": "top",
        "subtitle": "",
        "top_label": "",
        "top_url": "",
        "top_button_style": "button-secondary",
        "body": "<p>Black Friday puts strong pressure on launch timing, inventory readiness and fast replenishment. For jewelry brands, the most effective seasonal programs often combine proven best sellers with selected new designs so the campaign has both familiarity and freshness.</p><p>Craftaurum can support custom development or bulk production around your campaign calendar, with attention to sampling, approval, production pacing and delivery requirements. Early planning gives more room to prepare stock and reduce the risk of missing the promotion window.</p>",
